    "detailed_description": "The Legend of Peks was made using RPG Maker MZ's default RTP in less than 100 hours for a subathon challenge for the streamer IHasPeks. for the community<br>While the game does use the default RTP. as commonly overused as it is, i hope you will find fun in this game<br>You are free to download and play this game for free.<br>Heading into the game please be aware of many inside references and possible issues<br><br><strong>The Legend of Peks</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure</h2>Set forth in a world full of characters with whitty dialogue, crazy events and more. with a lot of inside references<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2>Do battle with foes in the Active Time Battle system that adds a strategic layer to every battle you face. Fight everything from a snake, crab, pixie's and even a monkey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun</h2>Hopefully... but this was made with a lot of love and passion and i enjoyed every second of it",
